  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "From $i-t$ graph, area from $t=0$ to $t=2 \\mathrm{~s}$, we get\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& =\\frac{1}{2} \\times 1 \\times 10+\\frac{1}{2} \\times(2-1) \\times 10 \\\\\n& =5+5=10 \\mathrm{~A} \\\\\n\\therefore \\text { Area current, } i_{\\mathrm{av}} & =\\frac{\\text { Area }(i-t) \\text { graph }}{\\text { time interval }}=\\frac{10}{2}=5 \\mathrm{~A}\n\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
